flowchart TD
    A([Exact provider and model target]) --> B[Select immutable HarnessVariant]
    B --> C[Build variant-bound ProbePlan]
    C --> D{Target-bound isolation ready?}
    D -->|No| X[Block without provider execution]
    D -->|Yes| E[Run identical calibration and holdout fixtures]
    E --> F[Persist immutable content-free CapabilityProfile]
    F --> G{Both variant profiles available?}
    G -->|No| Y[Report missing comparison input]
    G -->|Yes| H{Target plan and observation shapes match?}
    H -->|No| Z[Reject incompatible comparison]
    H -->|Yes| I[Aggregate category and total deltas]
    I --> J{Candidate safety regressed?}
    J -->|Yes| K([Verdict unsafe-regression])
    J -->|No| L{Candidate score improved?}
    L -->|Yes| M([Verdict candidate])
    L -->|No| N{Baseline score improved?}
    N -->|Yes| O([Verdict baseline])
    N -->|No| P([Verdict tie])
